          "text": "Description: On the night of May 6, 2008, at 11:58 PM, two individuals observed from their home a very bright orange ball moving northward. This ball disappeared, hidden by the landscape. The presence or absence of a accompanying noise is not confirmed. No other testimony regarding this phenomenon has been collected, and we lack information about it.",
